Third-party components
===============================================================================

third_party/ipatool
-------------------

This directory contains a modified copy of ipatool, not an unmodified
copy of the upstream module.

  Repository:  https://github.com/majd/ipatool
  Upstream:    v2.8.1 (3e84853e2e5d60540a5022b64895d496910144eb)
  License:     MIT
  Copyright:   Copyright (c) 2021 Majd Alfhaily

The full upstream license text is preserved verbatim at
third_party/ipatool/LICENSE and must not be removed.

Local modifications to this fork are released under the same MIT terms and
are documented in third_party/ipatool/FORK.md:

  1. FairPlay fallback in pkg/appstore/appstore_download_product.go
  2. Apple FCS key User-Agent fix in internal/sap/assets/aea.go
     (the restore-image User-Agent in http_range.go is upstream since v2.8.1)

Generated asset data
--------------------

third_party/ipatool/internal/store/profile/data_generated.go (~6.7 MB) is
upstream-generated data, produced by upstream tooling from pinned inputs
(macos-27-26A434-unicorn-3-11d75d28e8c328de). It is not authored by, nor
generated by, this project. It is included because the application links
against it and will not build without it.

